    "step8_outcome_verification": {
      "primary_intent": "Find a real Microsoft Careers job listing for an Applied Scientist role in Redmond, WA, open one relevant posting, and report four concrete facts from that specific posting: the job number, the work-site arrangement, two key responsibilities, and two preferred qualifications. A reasonable user would be flexible on which exact Applied Scientist posting is chosen (as long as it\u2019s relevant and includes Redmond), but not flexible on missing or made-up fields\u2014especially the required job number and the requested responsibilities/qualifications.",
      "reasoning": "Nitpicks: The chosen listing being \"Redmond + 4 more\" (not exclusively Redmond) is a minor issue; it\u2019s still an Applied Scientist role that includes Redmond and would satisfy an average user\u2019s intent for \"in Redmond\" search results.\n\nCritical issues: (1) The agent did not provide the primary deliverables: it failed to report two responsibilities and two preferred qualifications, explicitly stating it could not extract them. This alone means the task\u2019s required output is missing. (2) The agent asserted a specific job number (200017828) and a specific work-site arrangement (\"hybrid 3-days/week in-office\") despite no screenshot evidence showing any job number or work-site arrangement. Given the screenshots show no such fields in view, these claims are unsupported and appear fabricated relative to what was actually visible. (3) The agent\u2019s stated blocker is contradicted by screenshots that do show multiple bullet points in the job panel; while those bullets may be qualifications rather than responsibilities, they demonstrate the agent\u2019s claim that only headings were visible is unreliable.\n\nOutcome assessment: The agent successfully reached Microsoft Careers, searched for \"Applied Scientist\" with location \"Redmond, Washington,\" and opened a relevant listing (Applied Scientist II / Senior Applied Scientist - Responsible AI (CoreAI)). However, it did not deliver the required extracted information (responsibilities and preferred qualifications) and additionally provided unsupported/fabricated details (job number and work-site arrangement). From a user perspective, the task is not completed because the requested report cannot be trusted and is missing key required elements.",
      "output_success": false
    },
